      "mergeID": "5ca2a13f03326d7eea1140b4",
      "mergedPostDetails": "The current report system 'request an admin' is slow and most users don't use it.\nA new system to where users can select a user in their menu and report them with a reason would be ideal. After reporting for a specific condition - example 'crasher' it'd block their avatar.\n\nFurther integration with the trust system - adding a 'reported' user level triggered if a user isn't a friend and has been recently mass reported. This level would simply allow you to set avatar restrictions (disable avatar, voice, animations, particles).",
      "mergedPostTitle": "New report system - Report with reason",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "5a3dfb134a8da67427803df2",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "That screams for abuse. But in general I like the idea to \"tag\" someone as malicious so admins could follow the person invisible and see first hand what's going on.Even days later. The problem so far is simply that most hackers think nothing will happen, they wont get me anyway. But once the first of them get banned the word will spread and then they may reduce these annoying activities. And they or others should not even see that they got tagged. They get added to a list similar to the world list but not public and the guys with the most tags have to be observed for some time by an admin(only in public worlds of course). If they do what they got tagged for - ban! Maybe you could even log what they do somehow and let an AI check if there is something suspicious .If so a human should double check it. In case you find something give em what they deserve...",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
