  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2017-12-23T06:43:31.396Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "No offense or anything but this game really needs a way to report specific users for their behavior. 9/10 times I've called a moderator (usually because of someone saying the N-word or calling me and others 'a faggot' and stuff like that) they've never showed up, and the 1/10 time they do show up they don't seem terribly interested in doing anything about the user, because I have to tell them their name (usually somewhere crowded where it's hard to hear) and they mod has to go hunt them down, or that user left before the moderator showed up... I know blocking users is very effective but then others are still subject to that user's abusive behavior. Having an option to report a user directly would be very nice. Just my two cents; as this game increases in popularity the number of users who join specifically to \"troll\" and be abusive will increase exponentially.",
